  "summary": "This increment makes itinerary constraints semantically typed, corrects canonical examples, explicitly records remaining STRING-governed attributes as N3 build-phase violations, and adds canonical routing/decomposition rules. It also repairs the residual descriptive-value category and makes full/empty object state canonical.",
