**Gloss:** The closed set of time units usable with the duration_unit attribute.

**Category:** closed — the members below are exhaustive

**Members:**
- `unit_second` — Seconds. (natural-language synonyms: seconds, sec)
- `unit_minute` — Minutes. (natural-language synonyms: minutes, min)
- `unit_hour` — Hours. (natural-language synonyms: hours)
- `unit_day` — Days. (natural-language synonyms: days)
- `unit_week` — Weeks. (natural-language synonyms: weeks)
- `unit_month` — Months. (natural-language synonyms: months)
