  {
   "op": "revise",
   "construct_name": "Action",
   "grammar": "action ::= \"ACTION\" operation-id \"(\" action-attr (\",\" action-attr)* \")\" (\"->\" IDENT \":\" type)?\naction-attr ::= attribute-name \"=\" value\n-- target is first; all remaining attributes are alphabetical.\n-- E=STRING<entity-name>; R=STRING<recipient-value>; P=STRING<platform-name>; F=REF[STRING]; L=LIST[REF[STRING]].",
   "semantics": "Every Action signature below is normative; bracketed attributes are optional and all unbracketed attributes are required. Results have no descriptive provenance. Selector signatures are: search_web(target:E,[availability:search-value,category:search-value,color:product-attribute-value,compatible_with:F,currency:currency-value,genre:search-value,gender:product-attribute-value,location:location-name,max_price:NUMBER,min_rating:NUMBER,platform:P,shape:shape-value,size:product-attribute-value,trending:BOOL])->L; search_travel(origin:location-name,destination:location-name,date:ISO_DATE)->L; search_transit(origin:location-name,destination:location-name,date:ISO_DATE)->L; browse_trending(target:E,[location:location-name])->L; pick_up(target:E,[color:product-attribute-value,shape:shape-value,source:E|location-name,state:state-value])->F; extract(target:L,limit:NUMBER)->F; sort(target:L,rank_direction:search-value,rank_field:search-value)->L. Selected-object signatures are: place(target:F,destination:E|location-name,[location:location-name,relation:spatial-relation,state:state-value]); heat(target:F,[destination:E|location-name])->F; chill(target:F,[destination:E|location-name])->F; rinse(target:F,[destination:E|location-name])->F; slice(target:F)->F; pour(target:F,destination:E|location-name); add_to_cart(target:F); save_favorite(target:F). Page/form signatures are: open_page(target:E|P); click(target:E); read_page(target:E|P)->STRING; fill_field(target:E,content:content-value|STRING); submit(target:E). Communication/status signatures are: send_email(recipient:R,[content:content-value|STRING,tone:tone-value]); send_message(recipient:R,[content:content-value|STRING,tone:tone-value]); call(recipient:R,[content:content-value|STRING]); check_replied(target:R,deadline:UTC_TIMESTAMP)->BOOL; check_support_status(target:E|F,metric:metric-value)->BOOL; offer_discount(target:E|F,[content:content-value|STRING,discount_percent:NUMBER]); offer_expedited_shipping(target:E|F). List signatures are: create_list(target:E)->F; add_to_list(target:F,content:content-value|STRING); file_age_days(file:code-value)->NUMBER; path_in_folder(file:code-value,source:code-value)->BOOL. Code signatures are: modify_code(target:P|E,file:code-value,[method:code-value,property:code-value,call:code-value,assertion:code-value,expected_output:code-value,actual_output:code-value,reproduction_step:code-value,revision:code-value]); run_tests(target:P|E,[assertion:code-value,content:content-value|STRING]); add_file(target:P|E,file:code-value,[content:content-value|STRING]); delete_file(target:P|E,file:code-value). custom_<domain>_<action> requires target:E and may use only content:content-value|STRING. STRING alternatives named above are deliberate transitional N3 violations; all other attributes are category or literal governed.",
