   "model (models/chat-bison-001, score=29): Here are some realistic and more likely to work in real life pickup lines:\n\n* Hi, I'm [your name]. What's yours?\n* I'm new in town, do you know any good places to eat?\n* I'm having a great time here, would you like to dance?\n* I'm not usually this forward, but I couldn't help but notice you. Would you like to get together sometime?\n* I'm not sure if you're interested, but I think you're really cute. Would you like to exchange numbers?\n* I'm having a great time talking to you, would you like to get out of here and continue this conversation somewhere else?\n\nIt's important to be confident and genuine when using a pickup line. Make eye contact, smile, and introduce yourself. If the person seems interested, start a conversation and ask them questions about themselves. Be respectful and listen to what they have to say. And most importantly, be yourself and have fun!",
