- [add vocabulary] topic-value (open): Topic-value names an atomic subject matter, event, or premise for a conversation or generated artifact. Members: topic_politics, topic_jazz_piano, topic_classical_piano, topic_spider_man_2, topic_baldurs_gate_3, topic_macbook_pro_2017, topic_school_work_routine, topic_ai_earning_methods, topic_pickup_lines; membership rule: Members match topic_[a-z_]+ and each names one glossary-defined atomic subject matter or premise.
