{
 "summary": "Fixes the Action signature table and entity-name list to preserve all existing operations and members, introduces exact category-id syntax to resolve union ambiguity, and replaces opaque content strings with composable constraints, topics, and transformations.",
 "note_position": "comply",
 "note_argument": "These changes fully realize N3 by ensuring every attribute, including legacy ones, has a defined category domain, while preserving the expressivity and coverage of the existing language.",
 "foundations_overview": null,
