   "grammar": "generation ::= \"GENERATE\" \"(\" generate-attr (\",\" generate-attr)* \")\" \"->\" IDENT \":\" gen_type\n-- Legal attributes: target, audience, budget, constraints, content, currency, duration, duration_unit, format, locale, quantity, quantity_unit, stop_min_per_day, stop_requirement, style, topic, transformations, tone.",
   "semantics": "target requires STRING<artifact-value>; audience requires STRING<recipient-value>; tone, format, style, locale, currency, and units require their named categories; numeric constraints require NUMBER. constraints requires LIST[STRING<constraint-value>]; transformations requires LIST[STRING<transformation-value>]. topic requires STRING<topic-value>. content requires STRING<content-value>. quantity is exact only when paired with quantity_unit. budget is the maximum total monetary cost in currency. stop_requirement requires STRING<semantic-category-value>. Target is first; remaining attributes are alphabetical.",
   "worked_example": {
