tity unit if paragraph-count requests are supported."}, {"target": "Utterance", "change": "Define each speech-act's legal attribute signature or a normative shared signature. The current blanket list permits nonsensical combinations and does not determine whether, for example, ask versus inform must carry recipient, topic, content, constraints, or target."}, {"target": "topic-value / constraint-value / transformation-value", "change": "Add compositional constructs/categories for propositions, event ordering, relations, comparative/ranking criteria, factual recency/source requirements, character properties, and explicit exclusions. Do not rely on a fresh monolithic topic_/content_/constraint_ atom for an entire request when the request contains independently meaningful constraints."}, {"target": "basis", "change": "Add canonical encoding rules for mandatory document wrapping, optional modifiers such as inferred spatial relations, handle naming, and selection between content, topic, and constraints. These are necessary for N7 convergence and are exposed by the supplied independent translations."}]
