   "model (gpt-4, score=78): Racism stems from ignorance, fears, misunderstandings, and stereotypes. People tend to fear what they do not understand. However, continuous education and proactive efforts for a more inclusive society are vital for change. Remember, everyone has a role to play in combating racism.",
