  "nl": "I was absent from work for a week due to illness, while there were no vacations available to me at the time. I would like you to suggest an email message that I can send to my boss in a friendly manner so that he does not prevent me from working.",
  "trajectory_steps": [
   "assistant: Below is a ready‑to‑use email you can adapt for your situation. Feel free to tweak the wording to suit your workplace style, add any required documentation (e.g., a doctor’s note), and fill in the placeholders in brackets.\n\n---\n\n**Subject:** Request to Resume Work – [Your Name]\n\nHi [Boss’s Name],\n\nI hope you’re doing well. I wanted to reach out personally to let you know that I’m feeling much better and am ready to return to work starting [proposed start date, e.g., Monday, Jan 22].\n\nDuring my week‑long absence, I kept up with my tasks as best I could and have already taken steps to catch up on any outstanding items so the team isn’t impacted. If there’s any specific paperwork (e.g., a medical certificate) you’d like me to submit, please let me know and I’ll get it to you right away.\n\nI understand that my absence may have caused some inconvenience, and I appreciate your patience and flexibility. I’m committed to getting back on track quickly and contributing fully to our upcoming projects.\n\nWould it be possible for us to have a brief call or meeting this week to discuss any immediate priorities or updates I should be aware of? I’m happy to work around your schedule.\n\nThank you for your understanding, and I look forward to getting back in the office soon.\n\nBest regards,  \n[Your Full Name]  \n[Your Job Title]  \n[Your Contact Number]  \n[Your Email Address]\n\n---  \n\n**Quick checklist before sending**\n\n1. **Fill in the brackets** – especially the proposed return date and any required documentation.  \n2. **Add a copy of a doctor’s note** if your company policy requires one.  \n3. **Proofread** the message for any spelling or formatting errors.  \n4. **Send from your work email** to keep the communication professional.  \n\nGood luck, and I hope everything goes smoothly on your return!",
   "  [feedback: explicit_affirmation] The message was very good, eloquent, and concise, and I am very satisfied with it."
  ]
 }
