- [revise vocabulary] attribute-name (open): This category indexes every legal attribute. Exact category domains are determined by the operation signatures in Action, Generate, and Utterance. Members: target, recipient, audience, tone, format, style, locale, content, topic, constraints, transformations, events, character_properties, participants, predicates, evidence_requirements, ingredients, dietary_restrictions, quantity, quantity_unit, duration, duration_unit, max_walk_duration, max_walk_duration_unit, max_prep_time, stop_min_per_day, stop_requirement, budget, currency, availability, category, genre, rank_field, rank_direction, max_price, min_rating, limit, color, size, gender, shape, state, platform, location, origin, destination, destinations, source, relation, relations, date, deadline, metric, discount_percent, trending, file, method, property, call, assertion, expected_output, actual_output, reproduction_step, revision; membership rule: This index is exhaustive across all retained constructs and Action/Generate/Utterance signatures. Legacy transitional STRING attributes have been removed to enforce N3. The exact domain is determined by the specific operation signature.
