   "membership_rule": "A self-contained deterministic mapping procedure: operations are strictly limited to the enumerated members. If a domain-specific operation is required but missing, it uses the atomic token rule custom_<domain>_<action>.",
   "worked_example": {
    "nl": "Examine a book.",
    "braincode": "ACTION custom_household_examine(target=book)"
   },
   "change_type": "MAJOR",
   "rationale": "Adds missing operations to make the vocabulary identical to Action signatures, including browse_trending, book_hotel, set_active_store, select_schedule.",
   "addresses_note": "N3"
  },
  {
   "op": "revise",
   "construct_name": "Action",
   "grammar": "action ::= \"ACTION\" operation-id \"(\" action-attr (\",\" action-attr)* \")\" (\"->\" IDENT \":\" type)?\naction-attr ::= attribute-name \"=\" value\n-- target is first; remaining attributes are alphabetical.",
   "semantics": "Every signature is normative; bracketed attributes are optional. Result references REF[STRING] carry no category provenance. Search/Nav: search_web(target:STRING<entity-name>,[availability:STRING<search-value>,category:STRING<search-value>,color:STRING<product-attribute-value>,currency:STRING<currency-value>,gender:STRING<product-attribute-value>,genre:STRING<search-value>,location:STRING<location-name>,max_price:NUMBER,min_rating:NUMBER,platform:STRING<platform-name>,shape:STRING<shape-value>,size:STRING<product-attribute-value>,trending:BOOL])->LIST[REF[STRING]]; search_travel(origin:STRING<location-name>,destination:STRING<location-name>,date:ISO_DATE)->LIST[REF[STRING]]; search_transit(origin:STRING<location-name>,destination:STRING<location-name>,date:ISO_DATE)->LIST[REF[STRING]]; browse_trending(target:STRING<entity-name>,[location:STRING<location-name>])->LIST[REF[STRING]]; open_page(target:STRING<entity-name>); open_page(target:STRING<platform-name>); read_page(target:STRING<entity-name>)->STRING; read_page(target:STRING<platform-name>)->STRING. Interact: click(target:STRING<entity-name>); select_filter(target:STRING<entity-name>); apply_filters(target:STRING<entity-name>); fill_field(target:STRING<entity-name>,content:STRING<content-value>); submit(target:STRING<entity-name>). List/Extract: extract(target:LIST[REF[STRING]],limit:NUMBER)->REF[STRING]; sort(target:LIST[REF[STRING]],rank_direction:STRING<search-value>,rank_field:STRING<search-value>)->LIST[REF[STRING]]; create_list(target:STRING<entity-name>)->REF[STRING]; add_to_list(target:REF[STRING],content:STRING<content-value>). Physical: pick_up(target:STRING<entity-name>,[color:STRING<product-attribute-value>,shape:STRING<shape-value>,source:STRING<entity-name>,state:STRING<state-value>])->REF[STRING]; pick_up(target:STRING<entity-name>,[color:STRING<product-attribute-value>,location:STRING<location-name>,shape:STRING<shape-value>,state:STRING<state-value>])->REF[STRING]; place(target:REF[STRING],destination:STRING<entity-name>,[relation:STRING<spatial-relation>,state:STRING<state-value>]); place(target:REF[STRING],destination:REF[STRING],[relation:STRING<spatial-relation>,state:STRING<state-value>]); place(target:REF[STRING],destinations:LIST[STRING<entity-name>],relations:LIST[STRING<spatial-relation>]); place(target:REF[STRING],location:STRING<location-name>,[relation:STRING<spatial-relation>,state:STRING<state-value>]); heat(target:REF[STRING],[destination:STRING<entity-name>])->REF[STRING]; chill(target:REF[STRING],[destination:STRING<entity-name>])->REF[STRING]; rinse(target:REF[STRING],[destination:STRING<entity-name>])->REF[STRING]; slice(target:REF[STRING])->REF[STRING]; pour(target:REF[STRING],destination:STRING<entity-name>); open_container(target:REF[STRING]); close_container(target:REF[STRING]); turn_on(target:REF[STRING]); turn_off(target:REF[STRING]). Shopping/Booking: add_to_cart(target:REF[STRING]); save_favorite(target:REF[STRING]); set_active_store(target:REF[STRING]); book_hotel(target:STRING<entity-name>); book_hotel(target:STRING<location-name>); select_schedule(target:REF[STRING]). Comm/Status: send_email(recipient:STRING<recipient-value>,[content:STRING<content-value>,tone:STRING<tone-value>]); send_message(recipient:STRING<recipient-value>,[content:STRING<content-value>,tone:STRING<tone-value>]); call(recipient:STRING<recipient-value>,[content:STRING<content-value>]); check_replied(target:STRING<recipient-value>,deadline:UTC_TIMESTAMP)->BOOL; check_support_status(target:STRING<entity-name>,metric:STRING<metric-value>)->BOOL; check_support_status(target:REF[STRING],metric:STRING<metric-value>)->BOOL; offer_discount(target:STRING<entity-name>,[content:STRING<content-value>,discount_percent:NUMBER]); offer_discount(target:REF[STRING],[content:STRING<content-value>,discount_percent:NUMBER]); offer_expedited_shipping(target:STRING<entity-name>); offer_expedited_shipping(target:REF[STRING]). Code/Files: modify_code(target:STRING<platform-name>,file:STRING<code-value>,[actual_output:STRING<code-value>,assertion:STRING<code-value>,call:STRING<code-value>,expected_output:STRING<code-value>,method:STRING<code-value>,property:STRING<code-value>,reproduction_step:STRING<code-value>,revision:STRING<code-value>]); modify_code(target:STRING<entity-name>,file:STRING<code-value>,[actual_output:STRING<code-value>,assertion:STRING<code-value>,call:STRING<code-value>,expected_output:STRING<code-value>,method:STRING<code-value>,property:STRING<code-value>,reproduction_step:STRING<code-value>,revision:STRING<code-value>]); run_tests(target:STRING<platform-name>,[assertion:STRING<code-value>,content:STRING<content-value>]); run_tests(target:STRING<entity-name>,[assertion:STRING<code-value>,content:STRING<content-value>]); add_file(target:STRING<platform-name>,file:STRING<code-value>,[content:STRING<content-value>]); add_file(target:STRING<entity-name>,file:STRING<code-value>,[content:STRING<content-value>]); delete_file(target:STRING<platform-name>,file:STRING<code-value>); delete_file(target:STRING<entity-name>,file:STRING<code-value>); file_age_days(file:STRING<code-value>)->NUMBER; path_in_folder(file:STRING<code-value>,source:STRING<code-value>)->BOOL. custom_<domain>_<action> requires target:STRING<entity-name> and may use content:STRING<content-value>.",
   "worked_example": {
    "nl": "Place a cup on the counter and in front of the toaster.",
    "braincode": "ACTION pick_up(target=cup) -> cup_ref : REF[STRING]\nACTION place(target=cup_ref, destinations=[counter, toaster], relations=[on, in_front_of])"
   },
   "glossary_gloss": "Action performs an external operation using a complete, operation-specific signature. Overloads allow operations to accept different target categories, REF destinations, and compositional multiple relations.",
   "change_type": "MAJOR",
   "rationale": "Provides an exhaustive, exact-typed signature table covering all existing operations, preserving Mind2Web and embodied coverage while enforcing N3 category provenance. Adds REF destination and compositional lists to place.",
   "cites_source": "Why Agentic Systems Need Ontologies",
   "addresses_note": "N3"
  },
