   "assistant: I'd love to help you plan a meal! To give you the best suggestions, it helps to know a few things:\n\n**Tell me about:**\n- 🍽️ **What kind of meal?** (breakfast, lunch, dinner, snack)\n- 👥 **How many people?**\n- 🥗 **Any dietary needs?** (vegetarian, allergies, etc.)\n- ⏱️ **How much time do you have?**\n- 🎯 **Any occasion?** (weeknight dinner, dinner party, etc.)\n- 🛒 **Ingredients on hand?** or starting from scratch?\n\nOr if you just want me to **suggest something**, I'm happy to throw out some ideas! Just let me know. 😊",
