ertion:STRING<code-value>,call:STRING<code-value>,expected_output:STRING<code-value>,method:STRING<code-value>,property:STRING<code-value>,reproduction_step:STRING<code-value>,revision:STRING<code-value>]); modify_code(target:STRING<entity-name>,file:STRING<code-value>,[actual_output:STRING<code-value>,assertion:STRING<code-value>,call:STRING<code-value>,expected_output:STRING<code-value>,method:STRING<code-value>,property:STRING<code-value>,reproduction_step:STRING<code-value>,revision:STRING<code-value>]); run_tests(target:STRING<platform-name>,[assertion:STRING<code-value>,content:STRING<content-value>]); run_tests(target:STRING<entity-name>,[assertion:STRING<code-value>,content:STRING<content-value>]); add_file(target:STRING<platform-name>,file:STRING<code-value>,[content:STRING<content-value>]); add_file(target:STRING<entity-name>,file:STRING<code-value>,[content:STRING<content-value>]); delete_file(target:STRING<platform-name>,file:STRING<code-value>); delete_file(target:STRING<entity-name>,file:STRING<code-value>); file_age_days(file:STRING<code-value>)->NUMBER; path_in_folder(file:STRING<code-value>,source:STRING<code-value>)->BOOL. custom_<domain>_<action> requires target:STRING<entity-name> and may use content:STRING<content-value>.", "worked_example": {"nl": "Place a cup on the counter and in front of the toaster.", "braincode": "ACTION pick_up(target=cup) -> cup_ref : REF[STRING]\nACTION place(target=cup_ref, destinations=[counter, toaster], relations=[on, in_front_of])"}, "glossary_gloss": "Action performs an external operation using a complete, operation-specific signature. Overloads allow operations to accept different target categories, REF destinations, and compositional multiple relations.", "change_type": "MAJOR", "rationale": "Provides an exhaustive, exact-typed signature table covering all existing operations, preserving Mind2Web and embodied coverage while enforcing N3 category provenance. Adds REF destination and compositional lists to place."