  "trajectory_steps": [
   "assistant: # 🌊 3 Beach Travel Options for April\n\n---\n\n## 1. 🇹🇭 **Phuket, Thailand**\n- **Weather:** Warm and sunny, around 30°C (86°F)\n- **Why go:** Beautiful turquoise waters, stunning islands, vibrant nightlife\n- **Highlights:** Phi Phi Islands, Patong Beach, snorkeling & diving\n- **Best for:** Adventure seekers and culture lovers\n\n---\n\n## 2. 🇲🇽 **Cancún, Mexico**\n- **Weather:** Perfect, around 28°C (82°F), low humidity\n- **Why go:** Crystal clear Caribbean water, white sand beaches\n- **Highlights:** Tulum ruins, cenotes, coral reefs\n- **Best for:** Families, couples, and party travelers\n\n---\n\n## 3. 🇵🇹 **Algarve, Portugal**\n- **Weather:** Mild and pleasant, around 20°C (68°F)\n- **Why go:** Dramatic cliffs, golden beaches, fewer crowds in April\n- **Highlights:** Praia da Marinha, Lagos, fresh seafood\n- **Best for:** Relaxation and budget-friendly European travel\n\n---\n\n### 💡 **Quick Tip:**\nApril is a great month to travel — **before peak season crowds** and with **great weather** in most destinations!\n\nWould you like more details about any of these? 😊",
