  "nl": "hello, i want a detailed plan for the next 2 weeks to study my subjects(blood physiology , lower limb anatomy , blood histology , microbiology and biochmistry .notice that i cant tolerate studing for long time and i want you to assure that i have a fair free time to work and to learn new soft skill",
  "trajectory_steps": [
