---------|\n| 9:00 – 9:45 | Introduction to microbiology + bacteria classification |\n| 9:45 – 10:00 | ☕ Break |\n| 10:00 – 10:45 | Gram positive vs Gram negative bacteria |\n| 10:45 – 11:00 | ☕ Break |\n| 11:00 – 11:30 | Flashcards + summary sheet |\n| 12:00 – 12:30 | 💼 **Soft Skill:** Public Speaking (practice speaking for 5 min on any topic) |\n| **Afternoon** | ✅ FREE TIME |\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Friday — Biochemistry (Day 1) 🟡 Light Day\n| Time | Activity |\n|------|----------|\n| 9:00 – 9:45 | Carbohydrates metabolism overview (glycolysis) |\n| 9:45 – 10:00 | ☕ Break |\n| 10:00 – 10:30 | Make a simple flow chart of glycolysis |\n| 11:00 – 11:30 | 💼 **Soft Skill:** Watch a short video on **Critical Thinking** |\n| **Afternoon** | ✅ FREE TIME — longer break today! |\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Saturday — General Review (Week 1)\n| Time | Activity |\n|------|----------|\n| 9:00 – 9:45 | Review Blood Physiology flashcards |\n| 9:45 – 10:00 | ☕ Break |\n| 10:00 – 10:45 | Review Histology cell comparison table |\n| 10:45 – 11:00 | ☕ Break |\n| 11:00 – 11:30 | Quiz yourself on Microbiology + Anatomy diagrams |\n| **Afternoon** | ✅ FREE TIME |\n\n---\n\n### 🟢 Sunday — FULL REST DAY\n> No studying. Recharge completely. Spend time with family/friends or do something you enjoy.\n\n---\n\n---\n\n## 🗓️ WEEK 2\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Monday — Blood Physiology (Day 2)\n| Time | Activity |\n|------|----------|\n| 9:00 – 9:45 | Hemoglobin structure & oxygen transport |\n| 9:45 – 10:00 | ☕ Break |\n| 10:00 – 10:45 | Blood groups (ABO system + Rh factor) |\n| 10:45 – 11:00 | ☕ Break |\n| 11:00 – 11:30 | Practice MCQs on blood physiology |\n| 12:00 – 12:30 | 💼 **Soft Skill:** Critical Thinking exercise (solve a case/puzzle) |\n| **Afternoon** | ✅ FREE TIME |\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Tuesday — Lower Limb Anatomy (Day 2)\n| Time | Activity |\n|------|----------|\n| 9:00 – 9:45 | Muscles of the leg & foot + nerve supply |\n| 9:45 – 10:00 | ☕ Break |\n| 10:00 – 10:45 | Blood supply of lower limb (arteries & veins) |\n