 "summary": "Fixes the Critic's required changes: Canonical-Form now specifies an explicit multiplicity/decomposition algorithm, a defined CSR input scope, a causal-chain decomposition policy, an operation-selection tie-break rule, and a conversational-follow-up (REPLY_TO vs REVISES) rule; Bind's vocabulary-symbol collision is resolved with a mandatory _ref suffix instead of relying on static type; Generate's new attributes are added to attribute-name vocabulary.",
