   },
   "glossary_gloss": "Bind gives a value a name for later steps. Every derived handle now follows Canonical-Form's Handle-Naming Rule, and a handle that would otherwise read identically to a vocabulary symbol always gets a `_ref` suffix, so a reader never has to infer which meaning a token has from context.",
   "change_type": "MAJOR",
