    "glossary_gloss": "Flow-If branches on a Check, running THEN or the optional ELSE in its own fresh scope. Its worked example now shows the `_ref`-suffixed handle (role_manager_ref) produced whenever a bound result's base would otherwise read identically to the vocabulary symbol role_manager used elsewhere in the same body."
   },
   "change_type": "MAJOR",
