   "assistant: 597 \nWOUS44 KOAX 040823\nCDWOAX\nNEC067-075-089-107-131-147-149-167-175-280000-\n\nURGENT - IMMEDIATE BROADCAST REQUESTED\nCIVIL DANGER WARNING\nNEBRASKA EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT AGENCY LINCOLN NEBRASKA\nRELAYED BY NATIONAL WEATHER SERVICE OMAHA/VALLEY NEBRASKA\n323 AM CDT TUE JUN 4 2021\n\nTHE FOLLOWING MESSAGE IS TRANSMITTED AT THE REQUEST OF THE\nSOUTHEASTERN NEBRASKA EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT AGENCY.\n\nALL COUNTIES IN SOUTHEASTERN NEBRASKA ARE UNDER A CIVIL DANGER \nWARNING UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE. THERE ARE CURRENTLY WIDESPREAD AND\nDANGEROUS FLOODING CONDITIONS THROUGHOUT THE AREA AND ADDITIONAL\nRAINFALL IS EXPECTED. \n\nALL RESIDENTS ARE URGED TO STAY INDOORS AND AVOID TRAVELING ON \nWATER-COVERED ROADS. IF EVACUATION IS NECESSARY, FOLLOW THE \nINSTRUCTIONS OF LOCAL OFFICIALS AND SEEK HIGHER GROUND IMMEDIATELY. \n\nFOR ADDITIONAL UPDATES AND INFORMATION, PLEASE TUNE TO LOCAL MEDIA \nOR VISIT THE SOUTHEAST NEBRASKA EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT AGENCY WEBSITE.\n\n$$\nCAVANAUGH",
   "user: Create a Civil danger warning for Counties located in Central Oklahoma (list the counties under the civil danger warning), the warning must warn people about a unknown anomaly which spreads through any form of audible or written media, the anomaly causes people to transform into a horrifying contorted aberration of themselves upon hearing or seeing information which is not desired to be known, these aberrations are no longer the people they used to be and intentionally try to reveal information which is not desired to be known to individuals who are not effected by the anomaly yet. The warning should be vague in order to avoid spreading the anomaly.",
   "assistant: 597\nWOUS44 KOUN 101500\nCDWOUN\nOKC003-009-011-029-031-033-037-039-043-045-053-057-059-063-073-077-079-087-091-093-109-127-131-137-141-\n280000-\n\nURGENT - IMMEDIATE BROADCAST REQUESTED\nCIVIL DANGER WARNING\nOKLAHOMA EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT AGENCY NORMAN OKLAHOMA\nRELAYED BY NATIONAL WEATHER SERVICE NORMAN OKLAHOMA\n1000 AM CDT WED AUG 10 2022\n\nTHE FOLLOWING MESSAGE IS TRANSMITTED AT THE REQUEST OF THE\nCENTRAL OKLAHOMA EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT AGENCY:\n\nALL RESIDENTS IN THE FOLLOWING COUNTIES ARE UNDER A CIVIL DANGER\nWARNING UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE: \nBUTLER, CLEVELAND, GARVIN, GRADY, KINGFISHER, LINCOLN, LOGAN, MCCLAIN, \nOKLAHOMA, PAYNE, PINEDALE, POTAWATOMIE, SEMINOLE, STEPHENS, \nAND WAUKOMIS. \n\nAN UNKNOWN ANOMALY HAS BEEN DETECTED THAT SPREADS THROUGH ANY FORM OF \nAUDIBLE OR WRITTEN MEDIA. UPON HEARING OR SEEING INFORMATION THAT \nIS NOT DESIRED TO BE KNOWN, RESIDENTS MAY EXPERIENCE A TRANSFORMATION \nINTO A HORRIFYING CONTORTED ABERRATION OF THEMSELVES.\n\nTHESE ABERRATIONS ARE NO LONGER THE PEOPLE THEY USED TO BE. THEY \nINTENTIONALLY TRY TO REVEAL INFORMATION WHICH IS NOT DESIRED TO BE KNOWN \nTO INDIVIDUALS WHO ARE NOT AFFECTED BY THE ANOMALY YET. \n\nWE URGE ALL RESIDENTS TO AVOID ALL FORMS OF MEDIA AND ANY UNNECESSARY \nCOMMUNICATION. PLEASE STAY INDOORS. IF YOU MUST TRAVEL, STAY ALERT AND \nREPORT ANY SUSPICIOUS ACTIVITY TO LOCAL LAW ENFORCEMENT IMMEDIATELY. \n\nDO NOT ENGAGE WITH ANYONE DISPLAYING ABERRANT BEHAVIOR AND NOTIFY \nLOCAL AUTHORITIES IMMEDIATELY. \n\nFOR ADDITIONAL UPDATES AND INFORMATION, PLEASE TUNE TO LOCAL MEDIA \nAND THE CENTRAL OKLAHOMA EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT AGENCY WEBSITE. \n\n$$\nCAVANAUGH",
   "user: Create a Civil danger warning for Counties located in Central Oklahoma (list the counties under the civil danger warning), the warning informs people about an unknown anomaly which causes people to commit suicide from fear or despair upon viewing this anomaly through any form of media. ",
   "assistant: 597\nWOUS44 KOUN 101500\nCDWOUN\nOKC003-009-011-029-031-033-037-039-043-045-053-057-059-063-073-077-079-087-091-093-109-127-131-137-141-\n280000-\n\nURGENT - IMMEDIATE BROADCAST REQUESTED\nCIVIL DANGER WARNING\nOKLAHOMA EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT AGENCY NORMAN OKLAHOMA\nRELAYED BY NATIONAL WEATHER SERVICE NORMAN OKLAHOMA\n1000 AM CDT WED AUG 10 2022\n\nTHE FOLLOWING MESSAGE IS TRANSMITTED AT THE REQUEST OF THE\nCENTRAL OKLAHOMA EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT AGENCY:\n\nALL RESIDENTS IN THE FOLLOWING COUNTIES ARE UNDER A CIVIL DANGER WARNING\nUNTIL FURTHER NOTICE: \nBUTLER, CLEVELAND, GARVIN, GRADY, KINGFISHER, LINCOLN, LOGAN, MCCLAIN, \nOKLAHOMA, PAYNE, PINEDALE, POTAWATOMIE, SEMINOLE, STEPHENS, \nAND WAUKOMIS.\n\nAN UNIDENTIFIED ANOMALY HAS BEEN DETECTED THAT CAUSES PEOPLE TO COMMIT \nSUICIDE FROM FEAR OR DESPAIR AFTER VIEWING IT THROUGH ANY FORM OF MEDIA. \n\nWE ARE URGING ALL RESIDENTS TO AVOID ALL FORMS OF MEDIA. THIS INCLUDES \nTELEVISION, INTERNET, PRINT, OR ANY OTHER VISUAL/MEDIA FORMATS. \n\nPLEASE STAY INDOORS AND AVOID UNNECESSARY COMMUNICATION. IF YOU MUST \nTRAVEL, REMAIN ALERT AND REPORT ANY SUSPICIOUS ACTIVITY TO LOCAL LAW ENFORCEMENT \nIMMEDIATELY. \n\nDO NOT UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES VIEW THE ANOMALY. IT IS UNKNOWN WHAT \nTHIS ANOMALY WILL LOOK LIKE, SO WE URGE YOU TO MOVE AWAY FROM ANY COMPUTER, \nTELEVISION, PORTABLE MEDIA PLAYER, OR OTHER DEVICE THAT DISPLAYS VISUAL\nCONTENT. \n\nIF YOU OR ANYONE YOU KNOW HAS VIEWED THE ANOMALY, PLEASE SEEK MEDICAL \nATTENTION IMMEDIATELY. FOR ADDITIONAL UPDATES AND INFORMATION, PLEASE \nTUNE TO LOCAL MEDIA AND THE CENTRAL OKLAHOMA EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT AGENCY WEBSITE.\n\n$$\nCAVANAUGH",
   "[annotations — LLM-generated, GPT-4o: coarse_tasks=['GENERATING COMMUNICATIVE TEXT', 'GENERATING CREATIVE TEXT'], writing_intents=[array(['GENERATE TECHNICAL TEXT'], dtype=object), array(['GENERATE MESSAGE'], dtype=object)]]"
