**Meal prep** (cook chicken, rice, veggies in bulk on Sunday).\n✔ **Spice it up** (use garlic, paprika, cumin, hot sauce to avoid blandness).\n✔ **Hydrate** (3L water/day).\n✔ **Snack options** (if hungry between meals):\n   - 30g almonds (~170 kcal)\n   - 1 rice cake + 1 tbsp peanut butter (~150 kcal)\n   - 1 small apple + 1 tbsp almond butter (~180 kcal)\n\n---\n### **📊 Adjustments**\n- **Need more calories?** Add **1 tbsp olive oil** to meals or **extra rice/nuts**.\n- **Need less calories?** Reduce carbs slightly (e.g., less rice/bread).\n- **Want more variety?** Swap similar proteins/veggies (e.g., chicken → turkey).\n\nWould you like any modifications (e.g., more/less carbs, vegetarian options, budget-friendly swaps)?",
