      "semantics": "Action executes one external operation. Attributes use Canonical Form AOR and result names use HNR. place requires a REF target. pick_up returns REF[STRING]; rinse, heat, chill, slice, and pour each require a REF target, preserve that same entity identity, and return REF[STRING]. For these transforms, destination is the named resource or Canonical Form's relevant resource entity. A direct placement request expands to pick_up and place. Other operation signatures remain governed by their listed attributes.",
