      "semantics": "Bind gives names to LET values and Action, task-call, UTTER, and GENERATE results. LET requires an exact static type match, and a REF may only copy a visible REF of the same type. Derived Action, Generate, task-call, and UTTER names must follow Canonical Form HNR; _ref marks an Action result whose declared type is REF[T]. Scope, no-shadowing, and source-order visibility remain unchanged.",
